.DS_Store

# Donor WADs and key material are 100% user-supplied and must never be
# committed — the whole point of the donor model is that nothing
# copyrighted ships in this repo. These patterns are a backstop in case
# someone points a local donor store or key file at a path inside the repo.
donor-store/
donor-wads/
*.key
keys.bin
common-key*
